    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This plugin allows you to connect multiple WooCommerce stores via the REST API and to sync products between them.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<h4>Automatic Install</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Log into your WordPress dashboard and go to Plugins &gt; Add New</li>\n<li>Search for &#8220;Rudrastyh Product Sync for WooCommerce&#8221;</li>\n<li>Click &#8220;Install Now&#8221; under the Rudrastyh Product Sync for WooCommerce plugin</li>\n<li>Click &#8220;Activate Now&#8221;</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>Manual Install</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the plugin from the download button on this page</li>\n<li>Unzip the file, and upload the resulting <code>rudrastyh-product-sync-for-woocommerce</code> folder to your <code>/wp-content/plugins</code> directory</li>\n<li>Log into your WordPress dashboard and go to Plugins</li>\n<li>Click &#8220;Activate&#8221; under the Rudrastyh Product Sync for WooCommerce plugin</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Allows to sync products between standalone WooCommerce stores.",
